│  ● gitlab.com        1 ││  GL flow!1182 · priya · you're mentioned     ││ › ▾ general · 2 comments                                                           │
│    gitlab.com          ││▌ ● Tidy zsh startup                       1d ││   ada · 10h ago                                                                    │
│                        ││▌ GH dotfiles#31 · smorris · yours            ││     Looks good overall. Before you merge, a few things worth thinking about with   │
│  Show  s to change     ││                                              ││     the cached dump:                                                               │
│  [x] reviewing         ││  Can wait · 1                                ││                                                                                    │
│  [x] assigned          ││  · Clarify the install steps              3d ││     • The dump goes stale when fpath changes. Installing a new completion won't    │
│  [x] authored          ││  GL notes!12 · kai · approved by you         ││     show up until the file is rebuilt, which is the sort of bug that is very hard  │
│  [ ] drafts            ││                                              ││     to spot a month from now.                                                      │
│  [ ] noise             ││  ▸ Noise · 2 bot updates · ⏎ to expand       ││     • Two shells starting at once can both decide to rebuild it. Writing to a      │
│                        ││                                              ││     temporary file and renaming it keeps a half-written dump from ever being read. │
│                        ││  ── That's everything.                       ││     • compinit -C skips the security check on the files it finds, so a             │
│                        ││  7 in this view.                             ││     world-writable directory on fpath would go unnoticed. Is that a trade you want │
│                        ││                                              ││     to make on every machine this file lands on?                                   │
│                        ││                                              ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     One way to cover the first two:                                                │
│                        ││                                              ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     if [[ -n ${ZDOTDIR:-$HOME}/.zcompdump(#qN.mh+24) ]]; then                      │
│                        ││                                              ││     compinit -d "$tmp" && mv "$tmp" "${ZDOTDIR:-$HOME}/.zcompdump"                 │
│                        ││                                              ││     else                                                                           │
│                        ││                                              ││     compinit -C                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     fi                                                                             │
│                        ││                                              ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     That rebuilds once a day and uses the cache the rest of the time. I would      │
│                        ││                                              ││     still add a way to force a rebuild by hand, such as a rehash-completions       │
│                        ││                                              ││     function, so nobody has to remember where the file lives.                      │
│                        ││                                              ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││   smorris · 4h ago                                                                 │
│                        ││                                              ││     Good call on the rename. I'll take the once-a-day rebuild and add the helper;  │
